      "romanization": "Rītā: apni ki boiṭa pôṛen?\nKorim: hyã, ami protidin poṛi.\nRītā: tumi-o pôṛo?\nSoha: ami poṛi na, ami likhi.\nKorim: amar êkṭa kolom āche. tomake dii.",
